{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみねぇHAPPYBirthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最年長と最年少のまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かとよく話が合うよねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外に優しいゆみねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度ゆみねぇ家にとまりにいくからー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくなのだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はアメージングスパイダーマンを見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃくちゃ最高でしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はらはらドキドキ感動ストーリーでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと、小さい男の子が見るものだと思ってましたが全然違いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーマイガー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋愛ストーリもあり、人とひとの絆があり、大人から子供まで楽しめる最高の映画でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうみんなダーダー涙流して泣いちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、実はめっちゃ！\nバットマンが大好きなんだけど、今日、浮気しそうで......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにもー私というものは...。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、今日乃木坂46はレッドカーペットを歩かしていただいたり、Yahoo生中継をしたりと色々やらせていてだきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっさんこと、おねぇちゃん(宮澤)が今日もまた聞き間違えをしてましてぇ、最近多いんですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紹介させてもらうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今日もニッコリ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮澤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今日もマッコリ？笑？笑？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『なんでよーちがうしー！マッコリなんて言わんわぁ！なんやっ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮澤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『えっ？(;゜∇゜)？あっまじ？そう聞こえた！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちゃぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またもや聞き間違えをしてしまいましたねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てな感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではここで質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？ 最近聞き間違えた言葉は  ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっくら難しいかな？\n最近じゃなくてもいいよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様いつもいつもまあやの質問答えてくれてありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、何回もコメントしてくださってさぁ！\nあっ(゜ロ゜;！、\nまたしてくださってるー(^-^)/\nって思って........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読むとすんごーくパワーもらってさぁ！\nいいことかいてるとその一日はめっちゃ楽しくってさぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読みずらいけど最後までありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソンナアナタニ私はご褒美を......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チュッ((^3^)/照れ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も１日頑張りまぁやぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/13/9750398/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}